  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34675980",
      "title": "Handling Errors Without ErrorBoundary or CatchBoundary",
      "lectureOrder": 81,
      "videoOrder": 75,
      "sourceHash": "70a77de6d013f665efae04686787673b2d9533267637c74fd9e4282a9bd14395",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 3.48,
          "en": "Now last but not least",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.48,
          "end": 6.63,
          "en": "and not directly related to error handling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.63,
          "end": 9.75,
          "en": "I want to handle the scenario that I don't have any expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.75,
          "end": 11.82,
          "en": "as it's currently the case for me here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.82,
          "end": 13.77,
          "en": "I don't see any expenses here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.77,
          "end": 16.473,
          "en": "and I want to handle that scenario as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.15,
          "end": 21.81,
          "en": "For that, I'll go to this expenses.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.81,
          "end": 25.14,
          "en": "And here we got different ways of approaching this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.14,
          "end": 27.84,
          "en": "We could, for example, turn our loader back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.84,
          "end": 31.89,
          "en": "into a async function and then get our expenses here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.89,
          "end": 33.39,
          "en": "by awaiting them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.39,
          "end": 34.29,
          "en": "and then check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.29,
          "end": 37.5,
          "en": "if we don't have any expenses or,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 40.08,
          "en": "if expenses.length",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.08,
          "end": 41.13,
          "en": "is equal to zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.13,
          "end": 42.813,
          "en": "which means it is an empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.86,
          "end": 45.03,
          "en": "And if that's the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.03,
          "end": 48.36,
          "en": "we might want to throw a new response generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.36,
          "end": 51.87,
          "en": "with help of the JSON utility function that is provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.87,
          "end": 55.833,
          "en": "by Remix and imported from remix-run/node.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.21,
          "end": 59.58,
          "en": "If we do that, if we throw a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.58,
          "end": 63.33,
          "en": "we will trigger the closest cache boundary.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.33,
          "end": 65.1,
          "en": "So therefore here we could add a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 68.853,
          "en": "where we say could not find any expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.05,
          "end": 72.6,
          "en": "And then we could configure this response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.6,
          "end": 74.61,
          "en": "with the second argument passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.61,
          "end": 77.97,
          "en": "to this JSON function where we set the status code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 82.97,
          "en": "to 404 and maybe the status text to no expenses found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.36,
          "end": 85.74,
          "en": "If we do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.74,
          "end": 87.06,
          "en": "and we save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.06,
          "end": 90.12,
          "en": "you see that if I visit slash expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.12,
          "end": 94.25999999999999,
          "en": "I get this error page, the cache boundary in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.25999999999999,
          "end": 97.62,
          "en": "where I see these details being output on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.62,
          "end": 100.38,
          "en": "And that should be the expected behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.38,
          "end": 103.41,
          "en": "because I'm throwing a response and as I just explained",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.41,
          "end": 107.10300000000001,
          "en": "that will cause Remix to render a cache boundary.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.42,
          "end": 110.19,
          "en": "Now that's all nice, but",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.19,
          "end": 113.64,
          "en": "of course this kind of breaks the entire application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.64,
          "end": 117.15,
          "en": "We got this safety link, but that's about it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.15,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "Now, having no expenses is not a fundamental error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 122.55,
          "en": "with our application though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.55,
          "end": 123.93,
          "en": "it's a standard case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.93,
          "end": 127.17,
          "en": "and right now I couldn't even add any new expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.17,
          "end": 130.62,
          "en": "because I don't even see the button to add new expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.62,
          "end": 134.643,
          "en": "And therefore this might not be the behavior we want here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.69,
          "end": 137.79,
          "en": "Now what we could do is we could go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.79,
          "end": 142.07999999999998,
          "en": "to expenses jsx and export a cache boundary here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.07999999999998,
          "end": 144.99,
          "en": "If we have a closer cache boundary",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.99,
          "end": 146.85,
          "en": "than the root cache boundary",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.85,
          "end": 149.04,
          "en": "that cache boundary will be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.04,
          "end": 151.82999999999998,
          "en": "if an error response is thrown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.82999999999998,
          "end": 154.65,
          "en": "So if this route throws an error response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.65,
          "end": 156.87,
          "en": "and we have a cache boundary in this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.87,
          "end": 158.61,
          "en": "this cache boundary will be used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.61,
          "end": 160.77,
          "en": "If we only have one in a parent route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.77,
          "end": 162.873,
          "en": "that cache boundary would be used instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.86,
          "end": 167.25,
          "en": "So here if I add one, this cache boundary will be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.25,
          "end": 169.89,
          "en": "and here I could then output a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.89,
          "end": 173.31,
          "en": "where I for example, say error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.31,
          "end": 175.89,
          "en": "We might wanna show more meaningful details here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 175.89,
          "end": 178.8,
          "en": "but I wanna show where this would be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.8,
          "end": 182.04,
          "en": "So I just output error here and I save this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.04,
          "end": 184.59,
          "en": "You see that now I got my navigation bar back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.59,
          "end": 186.24,
          "en": "and I see error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.24,
          "end": 188.64,
          "en": "And we therefore provide a better user experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.64,
          "end": 189.87,
          "en": "than before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 189.87,
          "end": 192,
          "en": "I mean, especially as soon as we output more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192,
          "end": 194.733,
          "en": "meaningful information than just error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195.9,
          "end": 196.733,
          "en": "But nonetheless",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.733,
          "end": 200.22,
          "en": "we have the problem that we can't add a new expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.22,
          "end": 203.34,
          "en": "because the button that would allow us to do so is part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.34,
          "end": 205.71,
          "en": "of the component that we replaced now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 205.71,
          "end": 208.47,
          "en": "It's part of this expenses route component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 208.47,
          "end": 210.27,
          "en": "This expenses layout component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 210.27,
          "end": 213,
          "en": "And this component gets replaced entirely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 213,
          "end": 215.25,
          "en": "with the cache boundary component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 215.25,
          "end": 217.23,
          "en": "if an error response is thrown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 217.23,
          "end": 218.763,
          "en": "That's the default behavior.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 220.11,
          "end": 222.66,
          "en": "So therefore here, that's not really helpful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 222.66,
          "end": 224.07,
          "en": "And for that reason in general,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 224.07,
          "end": 227.97,
          "en": "I don't wanna throw an error response here in this loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 227.97,
          "end": 231.84,
          "en": "Instead, I just wanna return my expenses as I did it before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 231.84,
          "end": 235.2,
          "en": "And instead I'll go to my expenses layout here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 235.2,
          "end": 237.45,
          "en": "and there I'll add a new helper,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 237.45,
          "end": 240.36,
          "en": "constant has expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 240.36,
          "end": 242.64,
          "en": "Where I check if expenses is set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 242.64,
          "end": 245.04,
          "en": "and expenses length is greater than zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 245.04,
          "end": 247.29,
          "en": "which means we have expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 247.29,
          "end": 250.17,
          "en": "And then we can only render this expenses list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 250.17,
          "end": 252.573,
          "en": "if has expenses is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 253.92,
          "end": 257.88,
          "en": "Otherwise, if has expenses is false for which I'm checking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 257.88,
          "end": 260.52,
          "en": "below my expenses list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 260.52,
          "end": 265.443,
          "en": "we could output a section with an idea of no expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 267.03,
          "end": 271.593,
          "en": "where I then add h1 element, where I say no expenses found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 273.06,
          "end": 275.52,
          "en": "And below that maybe add a paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 275.52,
          "end": 277.33,
          "en": "where we say start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 278.31,
          "end": 283.02,
          "en": "and then add a link with the link provided by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 283.02,
          "end": 284.283,
          "en": "Adding some,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 285.51,
          "end": 286.65,
          "en": "today",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 286.65,
          "end": 290.34000000000003,
          "en": "and the adding some link here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 290.34000000000003,
          "end": 291.6,
          "en": "should lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 291.6,
          "end": 292.89,
          "en": "to the add page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 292.89,
          "end": 295.743,
          "en": "So to add as a relative path here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 297.63,
          "end": 301.11,
          "en": "So now this is not a cache boundary, but some part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 301.11,
          "end": 303.39,
          "en": "of my regular route component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 303.39,
          "end": 304.56,
          "en": "but it will only be shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 304.56,
          "end": 306.213,
          "en": "if I have no expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 307.17,
          "end": 309.69,
          "en": "And I can remove this links import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 309.69,
          "end": 312.813,
          "en": "which I accidentally added and this JSON import now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 314.04,
          "end": 318.6,
          "en": "And with that, I now got a much better user interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 318.6,
          "end": 323.34,
          "en": "And I'm showing this to you to show you how error boundary",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 323.34,
          "end": 326.25,
          "en": "and cache boundary work, but to also show you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 326.25,
          "end": 328.53,
          "en": "that you don't always have to use them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 328.53,
          "end": 332.7,
          "en": "You wanna throw errors and maybe throw error responses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 332.7,
          "end": 336,
          "en": "if certain things break and can't be done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 336,
          "end": 338.34000000000003,
          "en": "But you also wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 338.34000000000003,
          "end": 340.89,
          "en": "that you provide a good user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 340.89,
          "end": 342.63,
          "en": "And sometimes that might mean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 342.63,
          "end": 346.98,
          "en": "that you rather update a part of your regular UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 346.98,
          "end": 350.19,
          "en": "instead of showing a full screen error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 350.19,
          "end": 352.84000000000003,
          "en": "And that's why I'm showing this example here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
